        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-WST150SMTSS4, Back to Back Pair Wasatch Stainless Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Door Pull Set comes packaged with everything you need to mount them back-to-back on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. Made in the USA by First Impressions, the Back to Back Wasatch Stainless Door Pulls can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, and glass doors--just about anywhere a large diameter door pull is desired. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst150smtss4\"><b>First Impressions Model WST150SMTSS4</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PR-WST150SMTSS4 1-1/2\" Diameter Stainless Steel Pull Back-to-Back Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-WST03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262246\"><b>First Impressions PR-WST150SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-WST150018SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-WST150024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-WST150036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Door Pull Set",
                "description": "The 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Door Pulls Set comes packaged with everything you need to mount them back-to-back on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. Made in the USA by First Impressions, the Back to Back Wasatch Stainless Door Pulls can be used in many applications such as entry doors, commercial store front doors, and glass doors--just about anywhere a large diameter door pull is desired. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n",
